315	/**
316	 * Create an alias (`POST /add/alias`). `goto` is the destination address (or a
317	 * comma-separated list) mail to `address` should be delivered to. Throws a
318	 * MailcowError on any logical failure (e.g. the alias already exists).
319	 */
